cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Glideleaf, cite this repository and acknowledge fuba/winuc."
title: "Glideleaf: Windows-to-iPad mouse and keyboard sharing over Bluetooth LE"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/octxxiii/glideleaf"
url: "https://github.com/octxxiii/glideleaf"
authors:
  - name: "Glideleaf contributors"
abstract: >-
  An independent derivative of fuba/winuc with a multilingual Windows UI,
  forwarding mouse and keyboard input to iPad through a dedicated USB
  Bluetooth adapter using BLE HID over GATT. Alpha source preview;
  physical-device qualification remains pending.
keywords:
  - Windows
  - iPad
  - Bluetooth LE
  - HID over GATT
  - mouse and keyboard sharing
references:
  - type: software
    title: "WinUC"
    authors:
      - name: "fuba"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/fuba/winuc"
